n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & =\\int v(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int (3{t}^{2}+3{t}^{3})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={t}^{3}+\\frac{3}{4}{t}^{4}+K\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo determine $K$, we use the fact that $x(1)=2.$ Substituting this into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2 & =(1)^{3}+\\frac{3}{4}(1)^{4}+K \\\\ 2 & =\\frac{7}{4}+K \\\\ K & =\\frac{1}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the position $x$ of the particle at time $t$ is \n\n$$\nx(t)={t}^{3}+\\frac{3}{4}{t}^{4}+\\frac{1}{4}.\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362526 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362527 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362526 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362528 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362526 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362529 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362526 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362530 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362526 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362531 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362526 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362526 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362526 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362529 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362526 1080 #uuid "06753825-51eb-5b51-8b73-be9572e2a7be" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362527 1081 "x(t)=3{t}^{3}+\\frac{3}{4}{t}^{4}-\\frac{7}{4}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362527 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362527 1084 #uuid "de50d8d0-c6e5-5a66-8b10-e6d5df07649f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362528 1081 "x(t)={t}^{3}+\\frac{3}{2}{t}^{4}-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362528 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362528 1084 #uuid "345d417a-e247-5cbc-b60c-0ed6baf4ed96" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362529 1081 "x(t)={t}^{3}+\\frac{3}{4}{t}^{4}+\\frac{1}{4}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362529 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 1