_{1},2{v}_{2},3{v}_{3}}\n$$\n\n is linearly independent.\n\n- Statement III is false. Indeed, notice that \n\n$$\n0\\cdot {v}_{1}+0\\cdot {v}_{2}+1\\cdot 0=0.\n$$\n\nAs a result, ${x}_{1}{v}_{1}+{x}_{2}{v}_{2}+{x}_{3}0=0$ has a non-zero solution. This means that ${{v}_{1},{v}_{2},0}$ is linearly dependent. In general, any set containing the zero vector is linearly dependent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362554 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362555 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362554 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362556 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362554 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362557 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362554 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362558 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362554 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362559 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362554 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362554 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362554 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362559 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362554 1080 #uuid "eed24b82-e248-5d47-8d98-8441865e359f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362555 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362555 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362555 1084 #uuid "a6cd6819-3d4f-5d36-b01a-4a8f9b118206" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362556 1081 "I only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362556 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362556 1084 #uuid "46169318-8608-5ab9-93d4-86318e8fbf87" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362557 1081 "III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362557 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362557 1084 #uuid "6c3f3711-3ac9-50b4-a9b8-6b639948d5fc" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362558 1081 "I and II only" 1319