x of a vector field $F$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nUsing the parametrization, where $x=u$ and $y=v,$ our surface can be parameterized as\n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨u,\\,v,\\,4u-v⟩\n$$\n\nover the domain \n\n$$\nD={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 2,\\,-1\\le v\\le 2}.\n$$\n\nWe now compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(4u-v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,0,\\,4⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(u),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(4u-v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,1,\\,-1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}0 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4,\\,1,\\,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $F(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v)) & =⟨2x-z,\\,y-z,\\,z+y⟩{|}_{x=u,\\,\\,y=v,\\,\\,z=4u-v} \\\\  & =⟨2u-(4u-v),\\,v-(4u-v),\\,4u-v+v⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2u+v,\\,-4u+2v,\\,4u⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we calculate the dot product of $F$ and ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}) & =⟨-2u+v,\\,-4u+2v,\\,4u⟩\\cdot ⟨-4,\\,1,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =(-2u+v)\\cdot (-4)+(-4u+2v)\\cdot 1+4u\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =8u-4v+-4u+2v+4u \\\\  & =8u-2v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}⟨2x-z,\\,y-z,\\,z+y⟩\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(8u-2v)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{-1}^{2}(8u-2v)\\,\\text{d}v\\,\\text{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363001 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363002 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363003 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363004 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363005 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363003 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1080 #uuid "1a967ea9-62a2-59e7-9156-ea0fff576b7d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363001 1081 "8u" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363001 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363001 1084 #uuid "0f202e15-0fbe-50af-9841-523a939ec510" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363002 1081 "u-2v" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363002 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363002 1084 #uuid "176843b4-510b-5e14-95d1-94f7f1d2b76b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363003 1081 "8u-2v" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363003 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363003 1084 #uuid "5fb6d1ec-f761-53b6-be0f-80e6cadaee49" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363004 1081 "-4v" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363004 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363004 1084 #uuid "73b04bf4-208b-5a5c-aac6-b4ba092785fe" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363005 1081 "2u+4v" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363005 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 175921860455