has no critical points inside $Δ.$\n\n**Step 4**: Perform the change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}dV & ={∭}_{Δ}1\\cdot |-2w|\\,\\text{d}u\\text{d}v\\text{d}w \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{1}^{4}2w\\,dw\\,dv\\,du \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{2}du\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{1}dv\\cdot {\\int }_{1}^{4}2w\\,dw \\\\  & =[u]_{u=-2}^{u=2}\\cdot [v]_{v=0}^{v=1}\\cdot [{w}^{2}]_{w=1}^{w=4} \\\\  & =(2-(-2))\\cdot (1-0)\\cdot (16-1) \\\\  & =60.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363187 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363188 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363187 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363189 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363187 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363190 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363187 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363191 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363187 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363192 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363187 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363187 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363187 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363189 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363187 1080 #uuid "230795bb-1c46-5274-8505-2f18821e3031" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363188 1081 "12" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363188 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363188 1084 #uuid "cedf6411-1c50-521c-9753-b78164606edd" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363189 1081 "60" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363189 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363189 1084 #uuid "2156f8ec-e04e-51b8-bc96-f4f57ab9bd72" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363190 1081 "36" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363190 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363190 1084 #uuid "641c62ce-a323-535d-adec-144d3026c01d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [175921