 (-3) \\\\  & =12-3x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting the dot product equal to $0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & =0 \\\\ 12-3x & =0 \\\\ -3x & =-12 \\\\ x & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363552 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363553 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363552 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363554 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363552 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363555 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363552 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363556 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363552 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363557 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363552 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363552 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363552 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363556 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363552 1080 #uuid "af73e53b-f8ec-53d4-ad2f-688f3fcd26ab" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363553 1081 "3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363553 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363553 1084 #uuid "10a6363d-50b7-53ee-9211-bf98b3b730c4" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363554 1081 "2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363554 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363554 1084 #uuid "6d50033c-ac1e-5bc6-84ee-1d4b187400c2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363555 1081 "1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363555 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363555 1084 #uuid "2c9d11de-00b2-5f81-bbb0-9e2cfe2d24d2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363556 1081 "4" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363556 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363556 1084 #uuid "4f93f9db-ba0a-508a-846f-8f31e1eda3c6" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363557 1081 "0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true]