\text{d}u \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\cdot {u}^{2}+C \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\cdot {log}_{4}^{2}⁡x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363621 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363622 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363621 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363623 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363621 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363624 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363621 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363625 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363621 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363626 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363621 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363621 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363621 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363626 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363621 1080 #uuid "ebe67bfb-124a-593d-83ad-61599d1d4bef" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363622 1081 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\cdot {log}_{4}⁡x+C" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363622 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363622 1084 #uuid "e801e34a-0125-5366-bfbe-7c5392f185fd" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363623 1081 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{{log}_{4}⁡x}{2}+C" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363623 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363623 1084 #uuid "62971e29-5a80-538d-9637-1c44a46cb3f5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363624 1081 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\cdot \\frac{{log}_{4}^{2}⁡x}{2}+C" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363624 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363624 1084 #uuid "f1b2cf9d-77a0-5a78-af8e-45f3fc5b07a1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363625 1081 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\cdot {log}_{4}^{2}⁡x+C" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363625 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363625 1084 #uuid "0cd16dac-0e0f-5456-b5cc-6f633c746a42" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363626 1081 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡4\\cdot {log}_{4}^{2}⁡x+C" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363626 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363626 1084 #uuid "85ac5157-29fb-5860-accd-7d93b3916a42" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363627 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363628 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363627 1069 "q-314518" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363627 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363627 1071 "![](images/93/931548c09a49463878af155c92f9677e6095addf903d1258fe24f62915611d44.png)\n\nAll of the edges of a cube are shrinking at a rate of $1.5\\text{ cm/s}.$ How fast is the surface area decreasing when each edge is $4\\text{ cm}?$ Assume that the rate of decrease of the surface area is positive.\n\nThe cube's surface area is decreasing at a rate of\n{{field-1}}\n${\\text{cm}}^{2}/\\text{s}.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363627 1072 #uuid "85e32954-d99c-5c38-b8ce-b8844b299284" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363627 1074 "Let $x$ be the side of the cube, let $S$ be its surface area, and let $V$ be its volume. All of the variables change with time. In particular, we are given that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}=-1.5\\,\\text{cm}/\\text{s}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe would like to find $\\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t}$ when $x=4\\,\\text{cm}.$\n\nWe want to find the rate of change of $S$ knowing the rate of change of $x.$ So, we start with the formula for the surface area of the cube:\n\n$$\nS=6{x}^{2}\n$$\n\nNow, we differentiate with respect to time using the chain rule, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(S) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(6{x}^{2}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t} & =12x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now plug in the known values into the above expression. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t} & =12x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t} & =12(4)(-1.5) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}S}{\\text{d}t} & =-72.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the cube's surface area is decreasing at a rate of $72\\,{\\text{cm}}^{2}/\\text{s}.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363628 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363629 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363628 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363628 1077 "field-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363628 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363629 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363628 1080 #uuid "9c3dfd8f-2fcf-5673-ab36-222115c8cf2e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363629 1081 "72" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363629 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363629 1084 #uuid "44bd0684-6a71-5770-9c5f-022b135ea11e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363630 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363631 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363630 1069 "q-31588" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363630 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363630 1071 "What is the value of ${\\int }_{1}^{3}\\frac{{log}_{3}⁡x}{x}\\,\\text{d}x?$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363630 1072 #uuid "46f01b36-965c-5aab-a0e7-c33b421d2a82" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363630 1074 "Let $u={log}_{3}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}\\frac{{log}_{3}⁡x}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}{log}_{3}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}u\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡3{\\int }_{0}^{1}u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot (\\frac{{1}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{0}^{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363631 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363632 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363631 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363633 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363631 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363634 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363631 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363635 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363631 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363636 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363631 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363631 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363631 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363633 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363631 1080 #uuid "2c6f018d-495b-531f-bd03-e442b877a27d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363632 1081 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{{log}_{3}⁡x}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363632 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363632 1084 #uuid "c85c552c-0ff1-5148-a4d2-342abba93768" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363633 1081 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363633 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363633 1084 #uuid "e786ce68-d2d1-5eff-b775-2083018f9df2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363634 1081 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363634 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363634 1084 #uuid "8509899d-a879-55ba-9bde-472de5ff5912" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [