ince $f(x)$ is $\\text{continuous}$ at $x=0,$ the corresponding Fourier series converges to \n\n$$\nf(0)=0.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(0) & =\\frac{2}{\\pi }-\\frac{4}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{4{n}^{2}-1}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2n\\cdot 0) \\\\ 0 & =\\frac{2}{\\pi }-\\frac{4}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{4{n}^{2}-1}\\cdot 1 \\\\ -\\frac{2}{\\pi } & =-\\frac{4}{\\pi }{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{4{n}^{2}-1} \\\\ {\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{4{n}^{2}-1} & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364051 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364052 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364051 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364053 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364051 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364054 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364051 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364055 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364051 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364051 1077 "field-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364051 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364053 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364051 1080 #uuid "cf7482ba-c42e-5af4-af91-a8b902345ce3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364052 1081 "(-1)^{n+1}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364052 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364052 1084 #uuid "39262ec1-dc62-5850-81ab-fe6d8919dd1c" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364053 1081 "1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364053 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364053 1084 #uuid "e9d599d3-7bd1-53bd-bb88-263de9528713" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364054 1081 "0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364054 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364054 1084 #uuid "b131c64a-a172-53be-b5f5-bc1db39b9a92" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [1