{C}={P}_{C\\to B}^{-1}\\cdot [T]_{B}\\cdot {P}_{C\\to B}.\n$$\n\nwhere ${P}_{C\\to B}$ is the change-of-coordinates matrix from $C$ to $B.$\n\nOur goal is to compute $[T]_{B}.$ Solving this equation for $[T]_{B},$ we obtain the alternative formulation\n\n$$\n[T]_{B}={P}_{C\\to B}\\cdot [T]_{C}\\cdot {P}_{C\\to B}^{-1}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we compute the inverse of ${P}_{C\\to B}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{C\\to B}^{-1} & ={[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{aligned}]}^{-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(-2)\\cdot 1-(-1)\\cdot 3}[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can compute the matrix of $T$ relative to the basis $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[T]_{B} & ={P}_{C\\to B}\\cdot [T]_{C}\\cdot {P}_{C\\to B}^{-1} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-2 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-2 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & 7 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364110 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364111 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364110 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364112 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364110 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364113 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364110 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364114 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364110 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364115 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364110 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364110 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364110 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364111 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364110 1080 #uuid "4ba2eb2d-11d8-5382-b28d-dd3142a80d57" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364111 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 7 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{align