139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364355 1074 "Let $u={log}_{8}⁡(2x).$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2x\\operatorname{ln}⁡8}\\cdot 2=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡8}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡8\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $1/3$ | $2/3$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{6{log}_{8}⁡(2x)}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =6{\\int }_{1}^{2}{log}_{8}⁡(2x)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =6{\\int }_{1/3}^{2/3}u\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡8\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =6\\operatorname{ln}⁡8{\\int }_{1/3}^{2/3}u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =6\\operatorname{ln}⁡8\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}{|}_{1/3}^{2/3} \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{ln}⁡8\\cdot (\\frac{4}{9}-\\frac{1}{9}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡8\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364356 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364357 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364356 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364358 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364356 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364359 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364356 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364360 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364356 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364361 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364356 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364356 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364356 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364358 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364356 1080 #uuid "0cf307e2-aa61-5c5c-9a35-cb1835a62040" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364357 1081 "9\\operatorname{ln}⁡8" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364357 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364357 1084 #uuid "21c7787a-31a6-57b0-b969-bd5a3135ac96" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364358 1081 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡8" 131